{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_06",
  "title": "被包圍者",
  "storyCode": "NL-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fe3894e5032ea35ecb298755cb70f0cd3f83d4543b1b93f95e4c08a3609c1809",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 6-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "text": "開始了。感染者的行動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......他們真的會主動撞槍口上來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "text": "他們最好會。我們把動靜鬧大一點，董事會抓不住我們的把柄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "text": "動力爐那邊......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "你是在質疑我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "text": "不，不敢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "可以殺掉野鬃嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "text": "......當然，事已至此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "text": "有幾個獵物的話，飼主也不會大發雷霆了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "本來，就是從我手底下逃走的獵物......我只是取回我早該得到的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "通知第三小隊，收隊，跟我走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "發現野鬃！發現——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "太慢了，無胄盟！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "呃！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "躲在暗處耍陰招，你們已經忘了該怎麼對付騎士了嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "該死的感染者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "為了傑米，和那些死在你們手裡的無辜者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "咿——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "——艾沃娜！別忘了索娜說的，不要隨意下殺手......至少，在殺他們的時候，做好覺悟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......無胄盟，你殺過多少人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "......哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "道貌岸然才能讓你們自詡正義嗎？小鬼頭？我在黃金草原當賞金獵人的時候，可從來沒想過這個問題！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "忘了城市之外的地方，卡西米爾人是怎麼活著的了嗎？很簡單的道理！最強大的求生者全是冷酷的混帳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "——隨你怎麼說，無胄盟，但現在，是我贏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "輸了，死了，說什麼都是徒勞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......他剛才應該已經發出了求救信號。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "希望能把無胄盟吸引過來，不要干擾到格蕾納蒂的行動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "text": "遠牙，你那邊發現無胄盟了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "你那邊呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "text": "格蕾納蒂已經就位了，只等我們的信號。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "text": "但是，無胄盟的反應速度不會這麼慢......他們真的有被野鬃吸引過去嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "應該......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "發現無胄盟小隊，他們從四號大街的小巷進入了你的包圍網，艾沃娜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......艾沃娜？聽得見嗎？艾沃娜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "喂！？瑟奇亞克？艾沃娜！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "text": "......通訊......被......截斷了？不可能......在信號這麼密集的城市裡......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "安靜得有些可怕......艾沃娜，我有不好的預感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "無胄盟真的會被我們伏擊嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......不清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "比起這個，剛才開始我就接不到查絲汀娜的通訊了，她應該在高點盯著我們這片才對——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "（惡寒）——————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "——快跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然之間，艾沃娜感到了一股足以讓人當場嘔吐的窒息感。\n她不確定這種感覺真的是生理反應，還是某種毒素或法術的效果。\n有一道人影從高樓的頂端一躍而下。\n落在地上，卻像輕輕蒙上的紗布一般，沒有發出分毫聲響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......從那麼高的地方跳下來，連動靜都沒有嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "你們菲林都是這麼方便的生物嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......第三小隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "這些傢伙——什麼時候！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "（和剛才的那些無胄盟有質的差距......這傢伙，藍色的，是上次那個青金嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "你們先走......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "可是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "先走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "......你要活下來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "呃啊！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "——！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "不可能，根本沒看到她拉弓——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "青色的無胄盟保持著單手投擲的姿勢。\n她冷漠的面龐上閃過一絲不悅，因這場捕獵遊戲有一個不吉利的開端而不悅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......用，投的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "嘎啊，我的腿，我的腿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "咬牙，繼續跑！別停下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "喂，別瞎看了，我還在這裡呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......感染者都是些傻子嗎。數數看這裡有幾把弩對著你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "野鬃騎士，本來你好幾天前就該死了，不過正好，今天你還有一個逞英雄的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "跑吧，我也不想這麼無趣地結束這場獵殺。打發打發時間也好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "哈，你好像誤會了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "我看起來像是一直四處逃竄的那類人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......你像是自尋死路的那類人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "啐，感染者已經厭倦了這種苟且偷生的日子了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "無胄盟，你們只是一些躲在商業聯合會背後做著齷齪勾當的傢伙，這裡坦蕩活著的每一個人都比你們要更強！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "要記住他們每一個人的臉......！\n記住......那些騎士......那些卡西米爾人......這些陰狠的兇手......\n別放過，他們任何一個......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......無胄盟渣滓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "你和垂死的鉗獸戰鬥過嗎？無胄盟？你知道那些自知命不久矣的畜生，是怎麼戰鬥的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "自不量力......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "也許我會死，但我不會輸，你們，一定會在這裡付出代價。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "然後......我的夥伴們，將會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "看看你那張心存死志的臉，不想活下去的人還想著要贏，簡直是天方夜譚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "青色的無胄盟從背後抽出了一支箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......用箭矢當劍嗎？你在小看我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......你這......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "呃——！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "這就是你引以為豪的“速度”嗎？庫蘭塔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "別小看我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "嘎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "別叫這麼慘啊，我避開了要害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "讓我看看你能流多少的血吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "等你的血塗滿街道，那些躲在暗處的感染者，也就不敢反抗了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "......青金閣下，她畢竟是個感染者......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......擔心被感染，那就別來做這份工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "等她的怒火被死亡撲滅，處理那些感染者的反抗就會輕鬆許多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......查絲汀娜為什麼這麼久沒有通訊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "會不會遇到了什麼麻煩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "無論發生了什麼，還有五分鐘就到我們突襲的時候了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "索娜也應該抵達位置了，現在，我們只能相信彼此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......時間就快到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "各位，要平安無事啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......沒撐幾分鐘啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......繼續前進吧，感染者的窩點在這附近有七八個，但也許已經撤離了，一個個搜索。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "別......走啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "還沒，結束......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......她就交給你們了，我不想浪費時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "各單位準備，處決她——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "我不是說了，還沒——結束嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無胄盟成員",
      "text": "——她還有力氣反擊！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......我不想殺太多人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "老人和孩子，可以走。但是，留下十個感染者騎士的性命，我要回去交差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "你、你這......劊子手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "你把艾沃娜怎麼了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......按理說早該失血昏倒了，不過聽動靜，好像還在反抗呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "——你這魔鬼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "你們應該知道，就算逃過今天，也沒有意義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "我不喜歡說廢話。重複一遍，十個感染者騎士的命，換其他所有人的命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "我們憑什麼相信你們！？你們不過是一群殺人狂，一群變態罷了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......算上艾沃娜，只需要九個騎士的性命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "你們有勝算嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......算了，還是我自己動手快點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "別急啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "如果真的只是為了給上頭交差，我想，品質比數量更重要吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "您說，是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......托蘭·卡什。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "不是我自吹，我大概在通緝令上還挺值錢的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "如果你願意獻上首級，那今夜我確實不需要其他人的性命了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "別挑釁她！托蘭！她可是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "無胄盟的“青金大位”莫妮克閣下，是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......我說過，我討厭打擾我工作的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "現在，如果你不打算乖乖去死，那就是第三次了，托蘭·卡什。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "負傷的感染者騎士沒有看清發生了什麼。\n等鼓膜反應過來的時候，聽見了尖銳的碰撞聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "咻~拉弓速度確實有些離譜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......你竟然看見了？不，你的架勢，那是騎士的劍法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "賞金獵人何時懂得這種東西了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "別這麼說嘛，如果只會放放冷箭，設設陷阱，耍耍陰謀詭計，等著獵物上鉤......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "那和下賤的無胄盟有什麼區別？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "你躲不開太多次的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "唔哦，差點差點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "不過你可要小心一點腳下哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "——唔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......爆破物陷阱嗎，說到底還不是賞金獵人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "text": "這不是廢話嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "——！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "——衝鋒......你接受過騎士訓練？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "原來如此，難怪你會特地幫助臨光家族......你和臨光家族有牽連。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "雖然讓人很感興趣，但是，工作是工作。我們可不能浪費太多時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "text": "......特錦賽期間，叫車真麻煩啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "不好意思，請問一下好樂得騎士紀念品商店往哪走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "text": "都這麼晚了？我們找個地方吃飯吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "看啊！看啊！來自哥倫比亞的小將再度將藤蘿騎士壓制！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "出色的速度！後來居上——慢著、慢著！發生了什麼！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "不敢相信！！竟然在最後一段衝刺發生了這麼嚴重的意外！？摔倒？拜託，這可是特錦賽的現場！快振作起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "平時下班都這麼晚嗎？瑪恩納？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......您怎麼來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "早說一聲，我應該接待您才是，羅素閣下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅素",
      "text": "不勞你費心了，我很快就走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅素",
      "text": "今夜不會平靜，會有不少事情需要處理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅素",
      "text": "瑪恩納，那個提劍遠遊的遊俠回來了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅素",
      "text": "穿過屍骸堆砌的戰場與無垠廢土，被炮火焚燒的要塞盡頭，那個遊俠還沒有回來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "——還沒有收到聯絡，但是我們已經等不了了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "五分鐘內，我們要突襲並切斷核心電力源，確保商業聯合會所在的核心城區失去電力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "只有這樣，索娜才有潛入商業聯合會的機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "......玩挺大的啊，我喜歡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "......監正會的“朋友”應該已經秘密調走了這裡的安保，避免任何武力衝突。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "速度要快，準備行動——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "text": "什、什麼！？哪裡的爆炸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "能、能源區？為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "text": "灰毫！為什麼要提前行動！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "text": "不，我們根本還沒衝進去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "text": "——被算計了，快撤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "text": "睡吧，卡瓦萊利亞基，我心愛的大騎士領。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "text": "晚安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
